 "remarks": "Discover effortless waterfront living at The Maritime, an architecturally distinctive residence designed by award-winning architect Bruce Beinfield, situated directly along the Norwalk River. This spacious, light-filled, 2 bdrm, 2 bth condo features southern exposure w natural light throughout the day, an open-concept layout, floor-to-ceiling windows, hardwood flooring in the main living areas, and a private balcony with seasonal water views. The beautifully updated kitchen serves as the centerpiece of the home, featuring an impressive 10-foot granite island with seating, refinished European-style wood cabinetry, updated stainless steel appliances, and contemporary lighting. Both generously sized bedrooms feature walk-in closets with California Closet systems, while additional built-in storage provides exceptional functionality. A rare convenience in SoNo, the residence includes TWO dedicated parking spaces: one in the underground garage and another in a private outdoor lot. Residents enjoy a fitness center, lounge with fireplace and billiards, conference room, and convenient access to the Norwalk waterfront.",
